Both files are clean. Here's what changed and what to do now:

What was added to llm_provider.py:

GroqProvider now auto-detects vision models and sends the screenshot as an image — so llama-4-scout can literally see your page, same as Gemini, but much faster and no 503 errors.

TwoModelProvider is brand new — it chains two models:

Screenshot → llama-4-scout (describes: "I see a login form...")
Description → gpt-oss-20b (decides: {"action": "type", "element": "Username"...})

Update your .env file — :

LLM_PROVIDER=groq
LLM_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct

Or for the two-model setup :

LLM_PROVIDER=two_model
VISION_PROVIDER=groq
VISION_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct
DECISION_PROVIDER=groq
DECISION_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b